WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,730 --> 00:00:06,810
What are you doing here for a stroll? Just take a look.

2
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:09,650
Whatever you do, don't worry about us

3
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:10,930
We won't bother you either

4
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:13,670
Just a batch of fresh cannon fodder

5
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:15,630
Find out the research and development site for me

6
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:17,520
Who allowed you to follow?

7
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:19,480
Take your dog and get out of here

8
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:21,830
None of you are allowed here

9
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,890
Everyone put down their weapons and let the people go

10
00:00:32,290 --> 00:00:40,390
I allow you to follow our team. How about you?

11
00:00:41,470 --> 00:00:43,210
It's okay, we're about to leave

12
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:46,950
If you don't behave well, you'll take care of yourself until you behave well.
